!! Reference

```
Cross-repo synchronisation (spec-sync). Repos are named positionally; their order does not matter (roles are canonical)

Usage: mf sync <COMMAND>

Commands:
  plan    Compute a sync plan (into a freshly recreated plan repo)
  run     Execute the current plan (mutating the two repos), then prune succeeded ops
  show    Render the current plan with live red/green status (default: summary + reds)
  status  Print the per-link change/conflict states of a repo pair
  link    Manually link a record of repo_a to a record of repo_b
  unlink  Remove a link (optionally deleting one endpoint record first)
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
